WEBVTT

00:02:28.519 --> 00:02:32.315
Isodope is like a dealer of good memes.

00:02:33.316 --> 00:02:37.195
When I say meme, you probably think
of something like this.

00:02:38.196 --> 00:02:42.533
(Laughter)

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:49.582
What I mean by it is a fixed belief
or idea, good or bad,

00:02:49.624 --> 00:02:54.337
that spreads from person to person
and defines how we see the world.

00:02:54.837 --> 00:02:56.589
For example,

00:02:56.589 --> 00:02:58.758
people should have equal rights.

00:02:59.592 --> 00:03:01.219
Birds aren't real.